WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.290
A giant robed statue
towers over a city square.

2
00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:08.160
Cassius sneers that "this
man is now become a god",

3
00:00:08.210 --> 00:00:11.190
striding the world "Like a Colossus".

4
00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.770
Then Cassius remembers
the same man, exhausted,

5
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.490
hauled out of a river.

6
00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:20.360
Another story, another
place: a fever in Spain.

7
00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:23.710
And Cassius mocks him: "As a sick girl."

8
00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:26.100
A god, or a sick girl?

9
00:00:26.150 --> 00:00:27.970
Which Caesar is real?

10
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.290
In this mission, you'll hear
how Caesar talks about himself,

11
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.080
by name: "for always I am Caesar."

12
00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.570
You'll dig into Cassius's
story of the river,

13
00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:39.300
and his giant statue.

14
00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:42.080
And you'll see how
Caesar sizes up Cassius,

15
00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:45.560
the man with "a lean and hungry look".

16
00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:49.100
Your mission: decide which
Caesar is the real one.
